(1) THE CRUDE COMPARISON, carrier count c (c-1 later combs)
    window = 6/(7x);  crude budget with all later carriers > x
    c=3: k=2  budget < 2/5/x   vs window 6/7/x   => CLOSED
    c=4: k=3  budget < 3/4/x   vs window 6/7/x   => CLOSED
    c=5: k=4  budget < 4/3/x   vs window 6/7/x   => NOT closed by crude bound
    c=6: k=5  budget < 5/2/x   vs window 6/7/x   => NOT closed by crude bound
    c=7: k=6  budget < 6/x   vs window 6/7/x   => NOT closed by crude bound

